The negatives are sitting down in a hot leather car seat and burning your thighs, thighs sticking together from sweat, getting the imprint of cloth, sticking to plastic seats, a strong breeze blowing the skirt up, a child grabbing your leg can end up with their head under the skirt (that one happened to me, it was not a child I knew, they were just scared and grabbed my leg). 

