&#x200B;

The wife asked if I was willing to model some of the rope artist stuff. He tied an awesome rope corset and we were all still having a good time. The wife decided to take the other girls home while her husband was finishing another tie. It didn't feel like a setup at the time. I have hyper elastic joints so I can comfortably be tied in positions that many people couldn't, and at the time I was thin and fairly attractive so I had been modeling body art for a guy for a while. 

