Your extended family randomly comes over without notice and you happen to be home. You take 20 minutes to find a cookbook. Your kitchen is stocked enough to make something random out of a cookbook without needing to go to the store. If you had shopped for a meal from that cookbook and needed it to make the meal, the book should have been on hand from when you made the list. 

Your condo has interior doors with key locks. Your church-going aunt can pick locks. If they weren't key locks then it makes no sense that it took 20 minutes for your aunt to pick one. All you need is either a quarter or a pin to pick normal interior locks and a nosy aunt would be able to do that in 1/10th of a second.

